### Create a venue
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NC99",
  "type": "classroom",
  "capacity": 70,
  "facilities": ["projector", "ac"],
  "location": "Test room"
}

### Duplicate name (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NC99",
  "capacity": 70
}

### Invalid capacity (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NC98",
  "capacity": 0
}

### Invalid facility (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NC98",
  "capacity": 50,
  "facilities": ["jetpack"]
}

### Update capacity (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/venues/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 90
}

### Deactivate (expect 200)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/venues/PASTE_ID_HERE/deactivate

### Get one venue (expect 404 once deactivated)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues/PASTE_ID_HERE